</em></span><br/> <br/> <span style=''color:#339966;line-height:36px;font-family:Calibri, "font-size:24px;''><em><strong><span style="line-height:18px;">The main characteristics of PET Lamianting film: </span></strong></em></span><br/> <span style=''color:#339966;line-height:36px;font-family:Calibri, "font-size:24px;''><em><strong><span style="line-height:18px;">1) It doesn''t include solvent adhesive, which can protect the print color from changing. </span></strong></em></span><br/> <span style=''color:#339966;line-height:36px;font-family:Calibri, "font-size:24px;''><em><strong><span style="line-height:18px;">2) The adhesive effect is superior finish &amp; gloss, which is much better than that with the solvent adhesive. </span></strong></em></span><br/> <span style=''color:#339966;line-height:36px;font-family:Calibri, "font-size:24px;''><em><strong><span style="line-height:18px;">3) Time saving, you don''t need to prepare the glue beforehand. </span></strong></em></span><br/> <span style=''color:#339966;line-height:36px;font-family:Calibri, "font-size:24px;''><em><strong><span style="line-height:18px;">4) It can also be used on the traditional lamination machine. And it would not cause tunneling and swelling. </span></strong></em></span><br/> <br/> <span style=''color:#339966;line-height:36px;font-family:Calibri, "font-size:24px;''><em><strong><span style="line-height:18px;">Size: Any specification can be produced ranging from identify card to A2 paper. </span></strong></em></span><br/> <span style=''color:#339966;line-height:36px;font-family:Calibri, "font-size:24px;''><em><strong><span style="line-height:18px;">Thickness: According to the clients'' requirements, any composition of the total thickness from 32 micron to 250 micron can be produced, including PET+EVA. </span></strong></em></span><br/> <span style=''color:#339966;line-height:36px;font-family:Calibri, "font-size:24px;''><em><strong><span style="line-height:18px;">Packing: 50PCS/box. 100PCS/box. White or color box, outer carton box. Different packing ways can be according to the clients'' requirements</span></strong></em></span><br/> <span style=''color:#339966;line-height:36px;font-family:Calibri, "font-size:24px;''><em><strong><span style="line-height:18px;">For further information, please contact us instantly! </span></strong></em></span><br/> <br/> <span style=''color:#339966;line-height:36px;font-family:Calibri, "font-size:24px;''><em><strong><span style="line-height:18px;">The most important is that we discover the new technology, we can eliminate static, if you need anti-static laminating film, we can reach your request.</span></strong></em></span></p> <p style="color:#3A3A3A;text-indent:0px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;background-color:#FFFFFF;"> <span style="color:#339966;line-height:18px;"><em><span style=''font-family:Calibri, "''><strong><span style="font-size:24px;"><img alt="QQ20140605132718.jpg" src="http://kfdown.s.aliimg.com/kf/HTB1vrYOGXXXXXXjXVXXq6xXFXXXe/221290553/HTB1vrYOGXXXXXXjXVXXq6xXFXXXe.jpg" style="border:0px currentColor;"/><img alt="QQ20140605140759.jpg" src="http://kfdown.s.aliimg.com/kf/HTB1N123GXXXXXaUXXXXq6xXFXXXi/221290553/HTB1N123GXXXXXaUXXXXq6xXFXXXi.jpg" style="border:0px currentColor;"/><img alt="QQ20141209152829.jpg" src="http://kfdown.s.aliimg.com/kf/HTB1LJQbGVXXXXaaXFXXq6xXFXXXW/221290553/HTB1LJQbGVXXXXaaXFXXq6xXFXXXW.jpg" style="border:0px currentColor;"/><img alt="QQ20141209152838.jpg" src="http://kfdown.s.aliimg.com/kf/HTB1YiT8GVXXXXXpaXXXq6xXFXXXc/221290553/HTB1YiT8GVXXXXXpaXXXq6xXFXXXc.jpg" style="border:0px currentColor;"/><img alt="QQ20141209152849.jpg" src="http://kfdown.s.aliimg.com/kf/HTB1Q0AcGVXXXXcEXpXXq6xXFXXX9/221290553/HTB1Q0AcGVXXXXcEXpXXq6xXFXXX9.jpg" style="border:0px currentColor;"/><img alt="QQ20141209174625.jpg" src="http://kfdown.s.aliimg.com/kf/HTB14GZfGVXXXXbrXXXXq6xXFXXX5/221290553/HTB14GZfGVXXXXbrXXXXq6xXFXXX5.jpg" style="border:0px currentColor;"/><img alt="QQ20141209174743.jpg" src="http://kfdown.s.aliimg.com/kf/HTB1zZj9GVXXXXXGaXXXq6xXFXXXc/221290553/HTB1zZj9GVXXXXXGaXXXq6xXFXXXc.jpg" style="border:0px currentColor;"/><img alt="QQ20141209174917.jpg" src="http://kfdown.s.aliimg.com/kf/HTB1q9j8GVXXXXXJaXXXq6xXFXXXC/221290553/HTB1q9j8GVXXXXXJaXXXq6xXFXXXC.jpg" style="border:0px currentColor;"/>Silver ,golden, laser PET thermal lamination film </span></strong></span></em></span></p>', '2026-09-06 20:58:45');
